{"v":[{"a":["إِذَا","ٱلشَّمۡسُ","كُوِّرَتۡ"],"t":"When the sun is rolled up","l":"Idha Ash-Shamsu Kuwirat","w":[["idhā","When"],["l-shamsu","the sun"],["kuwwirat","is wrapped up"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلنُّجُومُ","ٱنكَدَرَتۡ"],"t":"When the stars are dimmed","l":"Wa 'Idha An-Nujumu Ankadarat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-nujūmu","the stars"],["inkadarat","fall, losing their luster"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡجِبَالُ","سُيِّرَتۡ"],"t":"When the mountains are set in motion","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Jibalu Suyyirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-jibālu","the mountains"],["suyyirat","are moved away"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡعِشَارُ","عُطِّلَتۡ"],"t":"When the relationships are suspended","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-`Isharu `Uttilat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-ʿishāru","the full-term she-camels"],["ʿuṭṭilat","(are) left untended"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡوُحُوشُ","حُشِرَتۡ"],"t":"When the beasts are gathered","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Wuhushu Hushirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-wuḥūshu","the wild beasts"],["ḥushirat","are gathered"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡبِحَارُ","سُجِّرَتۡ"],"t":"When the oceans are set aflame","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Biharu Sujjirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-biḥāru","the seas"],["sujjirat","are made to overflow"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلنُّفُوسُ","زُوِّجَتۡ"],"t":"When the souls are paired","l":"Wa 'Idha An-Nufusu Zuwijat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-nufūsu","the souls"],["zuwwijat","are paired"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡمَوۡءُۥدَةُ","سُئِلَتۡ"],"t":"When the girl, buried alive, is asked","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Maw'udatu Su'ilat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-mawūdatu","the female infant buried alive"],["su-ilat","is asked"]]},{"a":["بِأَيِّ","ذَنۢبٖ","قُتِلَتۡ"],"t":"For what crime was she killed","l":"Bi'ayyi Dhanbin Qutilat","w":[["bi-ayyi","For what"],["dhanbin","sin"],["qutilat","she was killed"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلصُّحُفُ","نُشِرَتۡ"],"t":"When the records are made public","l":"Wa 'Idha As-Suhufu Nushirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-ṣuḥufu","the pages"],["nushirat","